<title>GREECE: INTERBANK'S PAPATHANASIOU MOVES TO BANK OF AMERICA, ATHENS.</title>
<headline>INTERBANK'S PAPATHANASIOU MOVES TO BANK OF AMERICA, ATHENS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alexandra Papathanasiou, formerly at the bond sales desk of Greek private Interbank, joined Samuel David and Eugene Christodoulatou at the treasury sales desk at Bank of America, Athens. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
